msgid "OS backend integration"
msgstr "OS 后端接入"

msgid ""
"Nexus maintains Native, Baremetal, the reviewed FreeRTOS ports and the "
"explicit Native/M4 ThreadX subset. ThreadX has its own license, static-task "
"lifecycle and masking contract; it does not inherit the nine-core FreeRTOS "
"port scope. An additional RTOS is conditional on an actual integration "
"requirement and a reviewed kernel license, version, port and resource "
"budget. This document and the executable probe prepare that work; they do "
"not claim RTX, Zephyr or another kernel is supported. Applications continue "
"to own task topology, storage and shutdown."
msgstr ""
"Nexus 维护 Native、Baremetal、已审 FreeRTOS port 及显式 Native/M4 ThreadX 子集。ThreadX "
"有自身许可证、静态任务生命周期与掩码合同，不继承九核 FreeRTOS port 范围。新增 RTOS "
"需真实接入需求，以及审阅的内核许可证、版本、port 和资源预算。本文件与执行探针准备这些工作，不声称 RTX、Zephyr "
"或其他内核已支持。应用继续持有任务拓扑、存储和停机。"

msgid "Public contract"
msgstr "公共合同"

msgid "Boundary"
msgstr "边界"

msgid "Required behavior"
msgstr "要求行为"

msgid "Time"
msgstr "时间"

msgid ""
"Finite absolute monotonic microseconds in the same clock domain as the "
"caller; the clock continues while waiting. Use `NX_DEADLINE_NEVER` for "
"infinity and `nx_deadline_after` for saturating construction."
msgstr ""
"有限绝对单调微秒，与调用者同一时钟域；等待期间时钟持续推进。无限等待用 `NX_DEADLINE_NEVER`，饱和构造用 "
"`nx_deadline_after`。"

msgid "Completion"
msgstr "完成"

msgid ""
"A wake or changed sequence is a hint to recheck the authoritative predicate."
" Unrelated wakes never restart a deadline. The final predicate observation "
"can win over a timeout or another wait error."
msgstr "唤醒或序列变化仅提示重查权威谓词。无关唤醒不重启 deadline。最终谓词观察可优先于超时或其他等待错误。"

msgid "Admission"
msgstr "准入"

msgid ""
"A rejected operation retains no references. Timeout does not cancel, settle "
"or reclaim an accepted I/O request."
msgstr "拒绝操作不保留引用。Timeout 不取消、完成并排空或回收已接受 I/O 请求。"

msgid "Wait port"
msgstr "等待端口"

msgid ""
"One owner calls `arm` and `wait`; multiple publishers may call `wake` within"
" the documented context. Arming and the predicate recheck must close the "
"lost-wake window."
msgstr "唯一 owner 调用 `arm`／`wait`；多个发布者可在合同上下文调用 `wake`。Arm 与谓词复查必须关闭丢失唤醒窗口。"

msgid "Storage"
msgstr "存储"

msgid ""
"The application supplies adapter objects, stacks, task control blocks and "
"queue buffers. No hidden workers or maximum-size pools. Native POSIX "
"libraries may allocate internally; their cost is not a MCU budget."
msgstr ""
"应用提供适配对象、栈、任务控制块和队列缓冲，无隐藏 worker 或最大池。Native POSIX 库可能内部动态分配，其成本不是 MCU 预算。"

msgid "Notification teardown"
msgstr "通知销毁"

msgid ""
"Publishers and the single waiter must be quiesced before reclaim. A wait "
"error is insufficient evidence of quiescence."
msgstr "回收前发布者和唯一等待者必须静止。等待错误不足以证明静止。"

msgid "Task teardown"
msgstr "任务销毁"

msgid ""
"One lifecycle owner and one joiner. Entry return alone is insufficient; "
"successful join establishes reclaim. Cooperative stop is explicit."
msgstr "唯一生命周期所有者和唯一 joiner。入口返回自身不足以回收；成功 join 建立回收条件。合作式停止显式进行。"

msgid "Queue teardown"
msgstr "队列销毁"

msgid ""
"Close rejects new sends, wakes blocked users and permits retained items to "
"drain; users must exit before destroy. A raw kernel queue without close must"
" expose its separate owner protocol."
msgstr ""
"Close 拒绝新 send、唤醒阻塞用户并允许保留项排空；用户必须退出后才能 destroy。没有 close 的原始内核队列须暴露独立 owner "
"协议。"

msgid "ISR"
msgstr "ISR"

msgid ""
"Declare which calls are legal in task and ISR context. Reject exceptions or "
"priorities outside the kernel syscall ceiling before calling any ISR kernel "
"API."
msgstr "声明各调用的 task／ISR 合法上下文，调用任何内核 ISR API 前拒绝不满足 syscall ceiling 的异常或优先级。"

msgid "Masks"
msgstr "掩码"

msgid ""
"Preserve incoming interrupt masks on every return path. Baseline ports "
"explicitly restore their borrowed PRIMASK before kernel calls; Mainline "
"ports obey their BASEPRI ceiling. Never assume entry was unmasked."
msgstr ""
"每条返回路径保持进入中断掩码。Baseline port 在内核调用前显式恢复借用的 PRIMASK；Mainline 遵循 BASEPRI "
"ceiling。不能假定进入未屏蔽。"

msgid "Features"
msgstr "功能"

msgid ""
"Unsupported CPU, port, ABI, security or MPU combinations fail at "
"configuration. A host model cannot establish real kernel scheduling, "
"physical IRQ priority or board timing."
msgstr ""
"不支持的 CPU、port、ABI、security 或 MPU 组合在配置阶段失败。主机模型不能建立真实内核调度、物理 IRQ 优先级或板级时序。"

msgid ""
"`nx_wait_port_t` retains its direct callback ABI. The maintained [Wait cost "
"models](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/contracts/os_wait_cost/README.md) compare actual linked "
"alternatives. Backend integration must not create a second deadline helper, "
"runtime device registry or another assembly authority."
msgstr ""
"`nx_wait_port_t` 保留直接回调 ABI。维护中的[等待成本模型](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/contracts/os_wait_cost/README.md)比较真实链接方案。后端接入不能新增第二 deadline "
"helper、运行时器件注册表或装配权威。"

msgid "Integration sequence"
msgstr "接入次序"

msgid ""
"Record the actual requirement, kernel license/version, dependency identity, "
"CPU capabilities and explicit exclusions. Obtain the required source under "
"the repository's existing dependency process; do not edit vendored kernels "
"to hide adapter problems."
msgstr ""
"记录真实需求、内核许可证／版本、依赖身份、CPU 能力与明确排除项。按仓库既有依赖流程取得源码，不修改 vendored 内核来隐藏适配问题。"

msgid ""
"Add contract regressions first and retain actual RED failures. Use "
"GoogleTest/GoogleMock with real production adapter code, mocking external "
"hardware or kernel boundaries only. Add a real-kernel scheduler probe for "
"kernel behavior; mocked calls alone cannot establish it."
msgstr ""
"先增加合同回归并保留真实 RED。GoogleTest/GoogleMock 执行真实生产适配，只 mock "
"外部硬件或内核边界。内核行为需真实内核调度探针，mock 调用本身不能建立该行为。"

msgid ""
"Implement the static adapter and its context/deadline/lifecycle "
"documentation. Define notification ownership, shutdown/join and ISR priority"
" rejection before integrating I/O waits. Keep firmware C11, and keep test "
"C++ outside firmware targets."
msgstr ""
"实现静态适配及上下文／deadline／生命周期文档。I/O 等待接入前定义通知所有权、shutdown/join 与 ISR 优先级拒绝。固件保持 "
"C11，测试 C++ 留在固件目标之外。"

msgid ""
"Propose the port in the existing CPU/kernel resolver and CMake target graph."
" Authored TOML remains the sole selection authority. The resolver must "
"reject unsupported combinations. Integration changes require maintainer "
"review; the probe cannot add a backend to production configuration."
msgstr ""
"在既有 CPU／kernel 解析器与 CMake 目标图中提出 port。作者 TOML "
"仍是唯一选择权威，解析器必须拒绝不支持组合。接入变更需维护者审查；探针不能自行增加生产后端。"

msgid ""
"Create a strict probe declaration using the [Native "
"reference](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/contracts/os_backend_probe/native.json). Select `host`, "
"`baremetal` or `kernel`; list exact Google case identities for each "
"requirement. Kernel candidates add mask/ISR and real scheduler groups, a "
"source lock path and actual retained static kernel API symbols."
msgstr ""
"按 [Native 参考](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/contracts/os_backend_probe/native.json)建立严格探针声明。选择 "
"`host`、`baremetal` 或 `kernel`，逐要求列出精确 Google case 身份。内核候选增加 mask／ISR "
"和真实调度组、source lock 路径与实际保留静态内核 API 符号。"

msgid ""
"Run `scripts/ci/os_backend_probe.py` against the configured production "
"build. It rebuilds the nominated registered Google targets, discovers and "
"executes all their cases with fresh XML, checks exact case identities and "
"reports actual GNU ELF measurements. It rejects missing groups, filtered "
"identities, empty execution, skipped/disabled cases, missing tools and "
"source changes."
msgstr ""
"对已配置生产构建运行 `scripts/ci/os_backend_probe.py`。它重新构建指定已注册 Google 目标、发现并执行全部 "
"case，生成 fresh XML，校验精确 case 身份并报告真实 GNU ELF 测量。缺失组、过滤身份、空执行、skip／disabled "
"case、缺失工具和源码变更均拒绝。"

msgid ""
"MCU candidates additionally nominate a production firmware build/target, ELF"
" and its generated `resolved-cpu.json` or full `resolved.json` CPU "
"resolution. The probe rebuilds that firmware, verifies ARM ELF format, "
"checks short-enum and floating ABI against the existing production CPU "
"resolver, binds actual owned compile flags, rejects undefined "
"symbols/heap/test runtimes and reads actual retained kernel API symbols and "
"RAM/Flash sections. A missing source lock or CPU/backend not registered by "
"the resolver fails closed."
msgstr ""
"MCU 候选还指定生产固件 build/target、ELF 和生成的 `resolved-cpu.json` 或完整 `resolved.json` "
"CPU 解析。探针重建固件、校验 ARM ELF、对既有生产 CPU 解析器检查 short-enum 和浮点 "
"ABI，绑定实际所属编译参数，拒绝未定义符号／heap／测试运行时，读取实际保留内核 API 符号及 RAM/Flash section。缺少 "
"source lock 或 CPU／backend 未在解析器注册时直接拒绝准入。"

msgid ""
"Review raw commands, source identities, tests, actual static storage/Flash, "
"retained instructions and failure paths. Establish a clean candidate through"
" the normal independent CI/reproducibility process. Physical timing, "
"watchdog, low-power clock continuity and IRQ stress still require HIL "
"equipment."
msgstr ""
"审查原始命令、源码身份、测试、真实静态存储／Flash、保留指令和失败路径。经普通独立 CI／复现流程建立 clean "
"candidate。物理时序、watchdog、低功耗时钟连续性和 IRQ 压力仍需 HIL 装备。"

msgid "Executable scope"
msgstr "可执行范围"

msgid ""
"The declaration records a required contract; it is not evidence that the "
"implementation honors it. The runner actively produces fresh execution "
"rather than accepting a supplied successful XML or status marker. Source "
"snapshots bind owned implementation/tests, compilation databases and "
"compiled source files before and after execution. They establish a stable "
"working tree measurement, not clean Git qualification, dependency provenance"
" or reproducibility."
msgstr ""
"声明记录所需合同，不是实现遵守合同的证据。Runner 主动产生 fresh 执行，不接受提供的成功 XML "
"或状态标记。源码快照在执行前后绑定所属实现／测试、编译数据库与已编译源码，建立稳定工作树测量，不建立 clean Git 资格、依赖来源或可复现性。"

msgid ""
"`claim_support` must be `false`. A passing report states `support_promoted: "
"false`, `registration: not_performed`, `maintainer_review_required: true`, "
"`candidate_status: not_qualified` and `physical_status: not_executed`. "
"Kernel API retention proves linked symbols; the reviewed scheduler cases and"
" dependency process establish their semantics and identity. A source lock "
"digest alone is insufficient dependency provenance."
msgstr ""
"`claim_support` 必须为 `false`。通过报告声明 `support_promoted: false`、`registration: "
"not_performed`、`maintainer_review_required: true`、`candidate_status: "
"not_qualified` 和 `physical_status: not_executed`。内核 API 保留证明链接符号；审阅的调度 case "
"和依赖流程建立语义与身份。Source lock 摘要自身不是充分依赖来源。"

msgid ""
"Native test ELF RAM/Flash counters describe the host executable's sections "
"only. The Native fixtures allow a 256 KiB caller stack for host sanitizer "
"instrumentation; this is not a recommended MCU stack size. POSIX library, "
"process stack, test framework and sanitizer overhead must never be compared "
"as embedded adapter cost."
msgstr ""
"Native 测试 ELF RAM/Flash 计数只描述主机可执行文件 section。Native 夹具允许 256 KiB 调用方栈用于主机 "
"sanitizer，不是推荐 MCU 栈大小。POSIX 库、进程栈、测试框架及 sanitizer 开销绝不能比较成嵌入式适配成本。"

msgid ""
"The native reference command and candidate options are documented beside the"
" [probe fixture](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tests/contracts/os_backend_probe/README.md). CI must "
"retain raw logs, fresh XML and `report.json`; missing proof is a failed "
"admission probe."
msgstr ""
"Native 参考命令和候选选项见[探针夹具](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tests/contracts/os_backend_probe/README.md)。CI "
"必须保留原始日志、fresh XML 和 `report.json`；证据缺失表示准入探针失败。"
